Program: 
interface Device {  
void operate();
}
class Light implements Device, Runnable { 
public void operate() { System.out.println("Light is ON"); }
public void run() { operate(); }
}
class Fan implements Device, Runnable {
public void operate() { System.out.println("Fan is ON");}
public void run() { operate();}
}
public class Main { 
public static void main(String[] args) {    
Thread t1 = new Thread(new Light());    
Thread t2 = new Thread(new Fan()); 
t1.start();  
t2.start();    
}
}

Output:
Light is ON 
Fan is ON
